ss=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face challenging enemies with a unique combat system using fixed camera angles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge your enemies or hold them at a distance using your powers to better defeat them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Restore your health by grabbing a drink in the fridge, catching a nap on a bench or spending a night in the safety of your bed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft high-quality ammo and upgrade your gun to increase your fighting abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293730/extras/db6965da1898755329917e6c2d4c9440.poster.avif?t=1753837106\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293730/extras/db6965da1898755329917e6c2d4c9440.webm?t=1753837106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293730/extras/db6965da1898755329917e6c2d4c9440.mp4?t=1753837106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
